    "sentence_translations": [
      "I Like Halloween",
      "",
      "Halloween has arrived. My friend and I went to my neighbors’ houses to ask for candy to eat.",
      "My friend held a very pretty jack-o’-lantern. I wore a Superman costume.",
      "My neighbors thought we were very funny. They gave us lots of candy.",
      "",
      "After I got home, I watched a movie together with Dad and Mom.",
      "Although I’d already seen the movie before, I still felt a little scared. We all sat together, and I was no longer scared.",
      "",
      "At Halloween, I can play with my friends, and I can watch movies together with Dad and Mom. I like Halloween!"
    ]
